window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>'One of you is a murderer! None of you are above suspicion. You all had something to lose.' </p><p>Moments after welcoming his guests to a party, millionaire Harrison Pierce is murdered. But his death is only the first of many as, trapped on an isolated island, his guests start to die in increasingly bizarre ways. </p><p>Attorney Tony Peterson must join forces with a woman who destroyed his life years before, the beautiful but deadly Cassandra Collins. But can she be trusted? And what really is the secret of the mysterious Death Mask? </p>"; 
